{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_09_title", "source_sha256": "eb379228dda156105d1cff3808fb7358b241153b41d34138003400cc5546bb4d", "ja": "アイドルの基礎は？", "zh": "偶像的基础是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_09_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f5eb9932a1a3f25bb37dc88c0aca0f0435c80db8011c8b250a05c56672b0a55d", "ja": "基礎体力づくりのため、走り込みをしている\n奈緒、のり子、莉緒、麗花。ヘロヘロになっ\nてしまう奈緒や、余裕の麗花……四者四様の\nレッスン風景を見た後は、お待ちかねのイン\nタビュー！", "zh": "为了打好体能基础，正在进行长跑训练的\n奈绪、法子、莉绪和丽花。累得精疲力竭的\n奈绪，游刃有余的丽花……看过了四人各不相同的\n练习光景后，接下来就是大家期待已久的\n采访！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_09_1000_null", "source_sha256": "8f32c9c99b80610afc91e8a04328082f646fdacdfbd8445f203940f11bd255c6", "ja": "基礎レッスンに励むアイドル達……", "zh": "努力进行基础课程的偶像们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_09_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "69672eadd40aaa68cba925feeb999de8f7b9eee1a35d13beb619aae52f671a3d", "ja": "はぁっ、はぁっ……！\nあー、もう、しんどっ！　もう一歩も走れへん～！", "zh": "哈啊，哈啊……！\n啊——真是的，累死我了！一步都跑不动了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_09_1002_046rio", "source_sha256": "4c9bc202efdf79cf6f15d3f201214e6d2b26c81e21315540680c114c94ff282c", "ja": "奈緒ちゃん、しっかり！　体力はセクシーの基本！\nすべての道は、ヘルス＆ビューティに続くのよ！", "zh": "奈绪，打起精神来！体力可是性感的基本功！\n所有道路都通向健康与美丽哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_09_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "dd40554d4f04c6c62916746eaf3cc394866a5ae7daef5a0eb99ccdd1513d0bb2", "ja": "ふう……よ～しっ、休憩終わりっ！\n走り込み、あと100本行くよ！", "zh": "呼……好～了，休息结束！\n接下来再跑100趟！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_09_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "7481223b98734d820b3f0479a2775822f73567ac96f9affff1825163a45a4f9f", "ja": "え～～～～っ！？", "zh": "诶～～～～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_09_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "44ffdd2ba498076afce91fe9d8a91b582090772ce307156b574d831467cc8fd8", "ja": "わっ、見て見て奈緒ちゃん！　アルパカみたいな雲♪\n負けないように、私たちも走ろう！　ゴーゴー！", "zh": "哇，快看快看，奈绪！像羊驼一样的云朵♪\n为了不输给它，我们也跑起来吧！冲冲冲！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_09_1006_null", "source_sha256": "c229d9c0ec65b75c0c34388aa70a3c9d1177d24d95202c53b8aed6c91bfc8a73", "ja": "華やかなイメージとは裏腹に、アイドルは体力勝負。\n終わったようなので、早速インタビューを……。", "zh": "与光鲜亮丽的形象相反，偶像是一场体力的较量。\n看来已经结束了，那就趁热采访一下……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_09_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "d06167efc31c824bb0428ac53dd7b8bcd71df59e9780c79a00784dcc1eac3ade", "ja": "ぜえ、ぜえ……ちょ、アカン、一旦止めてください……\nまともにリアクションできひん……ゲホッ！", "zh": "呼、呼……等、等一下，先暂停一下……\n我实在没法好好做反应……咳咳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_09_1008_jimaku", "source_sha256": "0b74203627cdc8495c233f711cf6645f7b19e7cd8b5972cddee4482526181409", "ja": "アイドルとしての、『あなたの輝き』とは？", "zh": "作为偶像，『你的光芒』是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_09_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "ac89f2d0e626ede049c5871953889009296ea9fc3b446e57cb897d4c95f22a88", "ja": "そうだなぁ、アタシは……。", "zh": "这个嘛，我啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_09_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "349d4393521dbc6c922ee9da43335f36dbc01d82d21bf63e88cba499348668aa", "ja": "プロレスみたいなパワフルさ！　なんてどう？\nあんまりアイドルらしくないかな、あはは。", "zh": "像职业摔跤那样充满力量！你觉得怎么样？\n好像不太像偶像会说的话，啊哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_09_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "20845f4e32c7fdaa526f999e054c8310b660ae9ac37db45bebb7ad319e338946", "ja": "でも、そこがいいって言ってくれるファンもいるしね。\nアタシらしく、行けるとこまで行ってみるよ！", "zh": "不过，也有粉丝说那样正好啊。  \n我会按照自己的风格，努力走到能走的地方！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_09_1012_037nao", "source_sha256": "1063b241d39d676325db6b501e6601d5e04debd03b6b6090a48f2bd4604bf428", "ja": "私は……やっぱ、ノリがええとこやないですかね？\nワーッとノリよくやったら私も楽しいですし！", "zh": "我嘛……果然还是活泼会带动气氛吧？只要热热闹闹地尽情发挥，我自己也会很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_09_1013_037nao", "source_sha256": "ecf1ef84143c8e08154e1c29f134c27fc15571a9b68f5328272c511a4d1e69da", "ja": "それでお客さんも楽しんでくれたら、一石二鳥やんな♪\nお得なアイドル・横山奈緒、よろしくお願いします～！", "zh": "这样观众也能玩得开心，那可真是一举两得啦♪  \n超值偶像·横山奈绪，还请多多关照～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_09_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "c40da35c171bf148205a2a06596dcf5143b12884118378f7536bcc4b8f8725e3", "ja": "うーん？　劇場のみんなのキラキラや、山頂から見る\n朝日のキラキラなら、簡単に言えるんですけど……。", "zh": "嗯——？要说剧场大家闪闪发光的样子，或者从山顶看到的朝阳的光辉，我倒是能轻松说出来，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_09_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "4cf795d77a642c14ddd89e1250ff22424627e42244ba7c880fe997af1f6a13cb", "ja": "あ、何でも楽しめること、なんてどうですか？\n今だってこのインタビュー、とっても楽しいですし♪", "zh": "啊，什么都能乐在其中，怎么样？\n就连现在这场采访，我也觉得特别开心呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_09_1016_046rio", "source_sha256": "2ffe64c6aa8f24b6ef9fc64cfe38bd0f463341a62dd04051d8670998b9a40f32", "ja": "あら、もう私の番？　ウフフ♪　それはもちろん、\nセクシーよ！　……って言いたいところだけど。", "zh": "哦，已经轮到我了？呵呵♪那当然是性感啦！……虽然我很想这么说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_09_1017_046rio", "source_sha256": "d59b8afc6231bacd5cba19e2c38f15cb155ca5297c5521e7f8921339ca83d571", "ja": "一番の輝きは、『好き』って気持ちかも？\n私、劇場のみんなや、ファンのみんなが好きなのよね♪", "zh": "最耀眼的光芒，或许就是“喜欢”的心情吧？  \n我喜欢剧场的大家，也喜欢所有的粉丝呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_09_1018_046rio", "source_sha256": "6b72e37ec5d7396b40d86426d6167d7fc0ac9674063ee205dff0d68bfce0f779", "ja": "だからこそ、いつでもセクシーで、みんなにも\n好きになってもらえる自分でいたいと思うの！", "zh": "正因为如此，我想一直保持性感，成为一个能让大家都喜欢上的自己！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_09_1019_null", "source_sha256": "5566194d0a3509c638f5b91b80866c3707e440fe54e2de487f3079471c25c6f7", "ja": "なるほど……ありがとうございました！", "zh": "原来如此……谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_09_1020_046rio", "source_sha256": "fb355783276336a03e579c4defd072c25571981118ac5a85eded56ab110996e9", "ja": "ちょっと～！　それだけ？　真面目に話したんだから、\nもっと何か言ってよ、もうっ……いじわる！", "zh": "等等～！就这样？人家可是很认真地在说，至少再说点什么嘛，真是的……坏心眼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
